# **22-Month Realistic Roadmap — 2026 Edition**

Updated for Complete Beginners | AI + Infrastructure Track

Created: 2026  |  660 Days  |  50+ Projects

## **Why This Roadmap Was Updated**

**The original 18-month roadmap was excellent — but it was designed for someone who already has basic programming experience. If you are a complete beginner, Phase 3 (Programming) comes too late and is too short. Arriving at Python, Go, Kafka, and ML pipelines without any coding foundation is where most people quit.**

**This updated version adds Phase 0.5 (Python Foundations) before everything else, expands Phase 3 significantly, and adds deeper ML/AI content in Phase 7. The total time increases from 540 to 660 days — but you will be genuinely job-ready, not just certificate-ready.**

